Yeah, monks are fun... I've had fun learning a lot about playing a
fasting/famished monk.  If you save your prayer for every 900'ish turns
to get well fed, you can save a lot of weight spent normally carrying
food around.  With zero competition for food you can very easilly keep
two or more pets well fed.  The going is a bit tough as you start
getting weak/fainting until you can locate a =oSD.  On the plus side,
you'll constantly be working your wisdom...

Anyway, just a thought about another challenge you may not have
considered, especially since it sounds like you're aiming for monks.

